  "steps": [
   "Heat the oil in a large casserole over a high heat. Fry the mince for 6 to 8 minutes, breaking it up, until browned.",
   "Turn the heat to medium, add the onion and carrots and cook for 5 minutes until softened. Stir in the garlic, thyme and tomato purée for 1 minute.",
   "Add the barley, stock, Worcestershire sauce and a pinch of salt. Bring to the boil, cover and simmer for 30 minutes, stirring now and then. Halve the sprouts while it cooks.",
   "Stir in the sprouts, cover again and cook for 10 to 12 minutes, until the barley is tender and the sprouts are just soft. Add a splash of water if it looks dry.",
